{
  "id": "linked-list-reverse",
  "title": "单链表构造与三指针就地反转",
  "category": "data_structures",
  "description": "经典数据结构算法：动态构造含有 3 个节点的堆链表 (1 -> 2 -> 3)，通过 prev, curr, next 三个双向迭代指针完成优雅的就地反转 (3 -> 2 -> 1)。",
  "sourceCode": "#include <iostream>\n\nstruct Node {\n    int val;\n    Node* next;\n    Node(int v, Node* n = nullptr) : val(v), next(n) {}\n};\n\nint main() {\n    // 1. 构造链表: 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> nullptr\n    Node* head = new Node(1, new Node(2, new Node(3)));\n\n    // 2. 初始化三指针\n    Node* prev = nullptr;\n    Node* curr = head;\n\n    // 3. 逐节点转向\n    while (curr != nullptr) {\n        Node* nextTemp = curr->next;\n        curr->next = prev;\n        prev = curr;\n        curr = nextTemp;\n    }\n    head = prev; // 翻转后 head 指向原尾节点 3\n\n    return 0;\n}",
